{"ref":"BDB, דֶּ֫בֶר","hw":"דֶּ֫בֶר","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּ֫בֶר</span></big><sub>49</sub>  <strong>n.m. pestilence (</strong>cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">دَبْرٌ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">إِدْبَارٌ</span>, <em>departure, death</em><strong>)</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:3\" href=\"/Exodus.9.3\">Ex 9:3</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּ֑בֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:5\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.5\">Hb 3:5</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבָרֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:14\" href=\"/Hosea.13.14\">Ho 13:14</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>plague, pestilence</em>, in general <a data-ref=\"Exodus 5:3\" href=\"/Exodus.5.3\">Ex 5:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:15\" href=\"/Exodus.9.15\">9:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:12\" href=\"/Numbers.14.12\">Nu 14:12</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.25\">Lv 26:25</a> (H) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.21\">Dt 28:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.13\">2 S 24:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.15\">15</a> (+ v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.15\">15</a> a 𝔊 We Dr) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.12\">1 Ch 21:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:37\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.37\">1 K 8:37</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:28\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.28\">2 Ch 6:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 7:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.7.13\">2 Ch 7:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.9\">20:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:3\" href=\"/Psalms.91.3\">ψ 91:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:6\" href=\"/Psalms.91.6\">6</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.12\">Je 14:12</a> + 16 times Je, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.12\">Ez 5:12</a> + 11 times Ez, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:14\" href=\"/Hosea.13.14\">Ho 13:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:10\" href=\"/Amos.4.10\">Am 4:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:5\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.5\">Hb 3:5</a>. Read <span dir=\"rtl\">וּבַדָּ֑בֶר</span>, or the like, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.8\">1 S 4:8</a>, for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּמִּדְבָּר</span>, We Klo Dr.<br>†<strong>2.</strong>  <em>cattle-plague, murrain</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:3\" href=\"/Exodus.9.3\">Ex 9:3</a> (J) = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:50\" href=\"/Psalms.78.50\">ψ 78:50</a>.","next":"BDB, דֹּ֫בֶר","prev":"BDB, דָּבָר"}